# Go / devctl

Applies when editing `cmd/devctl` or `internal/`.

## Build and test

```bash
go build ./...
go test ./...
```

## Architecture

- `internal/runtime` — provider adapters; no imports from `internal/loop` (dependency direction is loop → runtime)
- `internal/loop` — universal agent loop (`devctl run`); run records under `.agentic/runs/`
- Adding a runtime provider is one entry in `internal/runtime/adapters.go`

## Runtime

Provider tokens (`claude-subscription`, `codex-subscription`) live in `.agentic/project.yaml` `runtime_preferences`, never in role files (ADR-002).
